note right of AppDbContext
  EF Core mappings:
  - one schema per bounded context
  - foreign keys with ON DELETE RESTRICT
  - value conversions for value objects
  - table-per-hierarchy users (role_type)
end note

note right of TelemetryDataProcessor
  IoT Telemetry Processor:
  - dequeues packets from ITelemetryDataQueue
  - stores TelemetryData and connects the IoT device
  - notifies VehicleLocationUpdated
end note

note right of MaintenanceRequestsController
  Maintenance flow:
  Pendiente -> Presupuestado -> Aprobado | Rechazado
  Aprobado -> En reparación -> Completado
end note

